  "new_claims": [
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "孙悟空梦见月夜海边高高的山崖上站着一只呆呆望海的石猴，石猴心想「极目之处，无边无界，我却不能再前进一步」。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "大海在月夜中闪着万点银光"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "梦中有人喊出「孙悟空」这个名字，石猴回头只见背后是一片茫茫黑暗，无人应答，它自称刚出生怎会有名字，认定这是梦。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "背后是一片茫茫黑暗"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "孙悟空睁眼醒来，立刻记起自己是谁、身在何处，确认金箍棒仍在耳中而安心；他觉得天宫的夜太静反而使他心中惶惑，并想到自己是否真的还愿回花果山。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "孙悟空睁开了眼睛"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "二郎神对紫霞说，孙悟空是杀人不眨眼的魔王，天宫与妖族打了多年仗，不知多少天兵神将死于他手，自己与他也交手多次，此妖危险至极；平日无人敢去蟠桃园，紫霞却常去。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0064/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0064"
      },
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "他是个杀人不眨眼的魔王"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "紫霞对二郎神说，她觉得孙悟空除了不爱答理人之外，不像传说中那么可怕。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0023/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0023"
      },
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "还是不像传说中那么可怕"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "紫霞说她想让孙悟空带她去花果山看看，只是想去看看，并说孙悟空讲那儿很美。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0023/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0023"
      },
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "孙悟空说那儿很美"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "二郎神表示自己刚好要去花果山，邀紫霞同去，紫霞惊喜地叫好。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我刚好要去，你要不要同去"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-8",
      "text": "二郎神与紫霞乘天神的巨大战车（厚甲壳、长满触角，被紫霞形容像怪兽），穿越黑色云层飞向地面，二郎神对此行目的只说「一会儿你就知道了」且面色冷峻。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "天神的巨大战车隆隆地驶向地面"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-9",
      "text": "叙述指出，紫霞忽然觉得二郎神此刻的神色和孙悟空那天梦中惊醒时的神色太像，两人心中都在惧怕着什么（此为紫霞的判断）。",
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0023/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0023"
      },
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "他们心中都在惧怕着什么"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [
        {
          "local_id": "claim-local-3"
        },
        {
          "local_id": "claim-local-8"
        }
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-10",
      "text": "紫霞走出战车后闻到腥臭，眼前是覆盖焦土的黑色群山、烧成炭的树木、浓重黑雾笼罩、不见天日、死气沉沉的山野与被形容为鬼哭的怪鸟嘶鸣。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "眼前是一片黑色的群山"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-11",
      "text": "二郎神宣告「这里就是花果山了」，并称这是紫霞向往的地方；紫霞不信、叫喊这不是花果山。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0064/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0064"
      },
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "这里就是花果山了"
        }
