      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-12",
      "text": "二郎神踢起地上一块石头，石头上刻有「花果山福地，水帘洞洞天」几个字。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "花果山福地，水帘洞洞天"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-13",
      "text": "二郎神对紫霞说，那猴子骗了她，花果山是群妖衍生之处，不可能风光秀丽，妖精不能住在花园里，只有神族天界才能风景如画。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0064/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0064"
      },
      "revealed_at": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000022.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000022",
          "chapter_order": 22,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "那猴子骗了你吧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-14",
      "text": "二郎神劝紫霞早离开，说这里群妖出没、不是仙女来的地方，回去后再别找那妖猴；紫霞说自己从没出过天界，想不到地面会是这个样子，二郎神回应并非所有地方都如此，礼天敬神之处风调雨顺、众类安乐。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0064/index.json",
